Server init.

>> x := Blob jauns: 65 tips: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programma iestatījums: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server saistīt: (
 Saraksts jauns ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Saraksts jauns ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x no: 0 garums: 1), jauna-rinda.
x atbrīvot.

